{"seq":3,"slug":"special-graphs","title":"特殊图与性质","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/special-graphs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bipartite-planar-graphs","title":"二部图与平面图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/special-graphs/bipartite-planar-graphs","wordCount":2228,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-coloring","title":"图着色理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/special-graphs/graph-coloring","wordCount":2295,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"eulerian-hamiltonian","title":"欧拉回路与哈密顿回路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/special-graphs/eulerian-hamiltonian","wordCount":2485,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"特殊图与性质-简介\">特殊图与性质 简介</h1><p>本章探讨具有特殊结构约束的图类及其深刻性质，从二部图的简洁对称到平面图的拓扑约束，从图着色的组合难题到欧拉与哈密顿回路的存在性判定，展现图论中结构分析的精妙之处。</p>\n<p><strong>二部图与平面图</strong> 介绍二部图的定义、判定算法（基于 BFS/DFS 的二着色）和 König 定理，讨论完全二部图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{m,n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的性质；然后转向平面图，证明欧拉公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V - E + F = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 及其推论，介绍 Kuratowski 定理给出平面图的完全刻画，讨论平面图在电路设计和地图绘制中的应用。</p>\n<p><strong>图着色理论</strong> 从顶点着色的基本概念出发，定义色数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>χ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi(G)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，讨论贪心着色算法和 Brooks 定理，介绍四色定理的历史意义和计算机辅助证明思路，以及边着色的 Vizing 定理，展示图着色在寄存器分配、频率分配等实际问题中的应用。</p>\n<p><strong>欧拉回路与哈密顿回路</strong> 对比欧拉回路（经过每条边恰好一次）和哈密顿回路（经过每个顶点恰好一次）这两个表面相似但复杂度截然不同的问题，介绍欧拉回路的充要条件和 Hierholzer 算法，讨论哈密顿回路的充分条件（Dirac 定理、Ore 定理）及其 NP 完全性。</p>\n<p>学习建议：本章定理较多，建议每学完一个图类就构造几个具体例子来验证定理条件，培养对图结构的直觉。</p>\n"}